flowchart TB
  browser[Desktop / Mobile / WeChat] --> ingress[Caddy HTTPS]
  ingress --> api[API container]
  ingress --> example[Public experience router]
  subgraph business[Connected workspace]
    api --> pg[(PostgreSQL business and jobs)]
    scheduler[Scheduler container] --> pg
    scheduler --> mq[RabbitMQ wake-ups]
    mq --> worker[Worker container]
    worker --> pg
    api --> redis[Redis sessions / coordination]
    worker --> oss[MinIO private attachments]
    worker --> external[IMAP / SMTP / Models / Calendars]
  end
  subgraph isolated[Per-request public walkthrough]
    example --> fixtures[Bounded synthetic fixtures]
    fixtures --> preset[Preset extraction]
    preset --> tools[Production processEmails / calendar / Trace]
    tools --> memory[Request-local results]
  end
